comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-07T19:37:31.293Z",codex-root,"Only the concrete child implementation task will be claimed and marked in_progress; feature, plan, and defect remain open until evidence closure."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-07T19:37:31.293Z",codex-root,"Use blocking waits for long gates and review providers, then one fresh exact-head inventory. Never persist live integration timing maps or private setup values."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-07T19:37:31.293Z",codex-root,Startup readiness spans both server bootstrap progress and client bootstrap output; one delivery plan can coordinate them while separate canonical items retain defect and feature semantics.
