plan_mode: executing
plan_scope: "Home Assistant Core startup subscription transport, typed CLI UX, setup wizard formatter contract, schemas, capabilities, docs, tests, live read-only acceptance, hosted review, merge, and PM closeout."
plan_harness: codex
plan_resume_context: "Continue on agent/startup-readiness-bootstrap-wizard. Official Core 2026.8.1 subscribe_bootstrap_integrations emits Record<string, number> via dispatcher; frontend uses the same type. Live Core is 2026.7.4. Isolated settings wizard corrupts json-compact with human banner. Only concrete implementation task should be claimed/in_progress."
plan_validation[1]{text,command,expected}:
  "Focused tests, full exact coverage, static gates, build, and read-only live E2E passed across all six output formats.","bun run test:coverage and HASSIO_READONLY=true bun run test:e2e:live",100/100/100/100 coverage and parseable nonempty output in every format without private receipt fields.
plan_decisions[1]{ts,author,decision,rationale,evidence}:
  "2026-08-07T19:52:37.795Z",codex-root,Expose startup readiness as a typed bounded ws subcommand rather than require generic passthrough.,"A typed surface provides deterministic schemas, bounded capture, automatic unsubscribe, capabilities discovery, help, and agent guidance while retaining generic passthrough for forward compatibility.",Core 2026.8.1 stable command registry and existing HomeAssistantWebSocketClient collector.
plan_discoveries[1]{ts,author,text}:
  "2026-08-07T19:52:38.192Z",codex-root,"Non-interactive setup mixed banner and prose with requested structured output, so strict JSON consumers failed before reaching a receipt."
